<title>INDIA: At least 13 killed, 24 injured in India bus accident.</title>
<headline>At least 13 killed, 24 injured in India bus accident.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 13 people were killed and 24 injured when a pick-up van plunged into a gorge in the southern Indian state of Karnataka on Thursday, the United News of India (UNI) said.</p>
<p>The agency said the van was carrying guests to a wedding party. The dead included four women and four children.</p>
